{"3560730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MORTALITY DECOMP. KILLERS", "steam_appid": 3560730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [3887230, 3560810, 4058320], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560730/extras/c454a07d45fe5b3c29a5aabe628928b1.avif?t=1766108082\" width=800 height=682 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JUST LIKE IN THE PAPERS.</strong><i><br>MORTALITY DECOMP. KILLERS</i> is a short, fast-paced 3rd person horror/comedy hybrid of games like <i>Hotline Miami</i> and <i>Post Void,</i> with hand-drawn visuals inspired loosely by retro detective comics. You'll step into the well-polished shoes of Clive, an undead detective working to take down the criminals that initially killed him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LIVE. DIE. LIVE AGAIN.</strong><br>When a parasite reawakens detective Clive from death, he is recruited into a secret taskforce to stop those that killed him from weaponizing this newfound immortality. Slay crooks and goons in semi-linear corridor levels that are built for honing in and optimising your own quickest path through. Prepare to die, and then die again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560730/extras/e3d70fe16c07d6cdd6822e6114c517c8.avif?t=1766108082\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560730/extras_big/e3d70fe16c07d6cdd6822e6114c517c8.avif?t=1766108082 width=800 height=80 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560730/extras/c454a07d45fe5b3c29a5aabe628928b1.avif?t=1766108082\" width=800 height=682 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JUST LIKE IN THE PAPERS.</strong><i><br>MORTALITY DECOMP. KILLERS</i> is a short, fast-paced 3rd person horror/comedy hybrid of games like <i>Hotline Miami</i> and <i>Post Void,</i> with hand-drawn visuals inspired loosely by retro detective comics. You'll step into the well-polished shoes of Clive, an undead detective working to take down the criminals that initially killed him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LIVE. DIE. LIVE AGAIN.</strong><br>When a parasite reawakens detective Clive from death, he is recruited into a secret taskforce to stop those that killed him from weaponizing this newfound immortality. Slay crooks and goons in semi-linear corridor levels that are built for honing in and optimising your own quickest path through. Prepare to die, and then die again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560730/extras/e3d70fe16c07d6cdd6822e6114c517c8.avif?t=1766108082\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560730/extras_big/e3d70fe16c07d6cdd6822e6114c517c8.avif?t=1766108082 width=800 height=80 /></span></p>", "short_description": "When a parasite reawakens detective Clive from death, he is recruited into a secret taskforce to stop those that killed him from weaponizing this newfound immortality.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560730/8f7dd43238feebcbc9781cbba1e5bc297ee9de97/header.jpg?t=1766108082", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560730/6c69a4535efbbf54a2df5a65c6ea813ee5211abd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766108082", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560730/6c69